{
  "title": { "zh": "按形状分解目标" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "builds": "introRules",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "到这里，每一步用哪条规则，都是你看过目标后选定的。引入规则看的是目标：目标是什么结构，就是哪条引入规则造出来的。设计出的证明助手会成为新元件「分解目标」。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "s-intro",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "becomes",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Rain ∧ Wind", "becomes": [["Rain", "Wind"]] },
        { "goal": "Rain → Wet", "becomes": [["Rain ⊢ Wet"]] },
        { "goal": "Rain ∨ Wind", "becomes": [["Rain"], ["Wind"]] },
        { "goal": "∀x. Human(x) → Mortal(x)", "becomes": [["⋀a. Human(a) → Mortal(a)"]] },
        { "goal": "∃x. Human(x)", "becomes": [["Human(?t)"]] },
        { "goal": "Rain", "becomes": [] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：用每一条对得上的引入规则把目标倒着拆一步，每种拆法都留下；一条都对不上时失败。"
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "引入规则有六条：拼接、假设框、补充左右两条、任取框、概括。"
        },
        {
          "zh": "<part-ref to=\"part:append\"></part-ref>上可以选六个框。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0 = append[ways=\"6\"](in, first: c1, second: c2, third: c3, fourth: c4, fifth: c5, sixth: c6) {",
        "  first {",
        "    c1r0 = andI()",
        "    c1 = rule(c0.first, c1r0)",
        "  }",
        "  second {",
        "    c2r0 = impI()",
        "    c2 = rule(c0.second, c2r0)",
        "  }",
        "  third {",
        "    c3r0 = orI[use=[disjI1]]()",
        "    c3 = rule(c0.third, c3r0)",
        "  }",
        "  fourth {",
        "    c4r0 = orI[use=[disjI2]]()",
        "    c4 = rule(c0.fourth, c4r0)",
        "  }",
        "  fifth {",
        "    c5r0 = allI()",
        "    c5 = rule(c0.fifth, c5r0)",
        "  }",
        "  sixth {",
        "    c6r0 = exI()",
        "    c6 = rule(c0.sixth, c6r0)",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
